000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. FEECALC.
000300*===============================================================*
000400* 手数料計算プログラム                                        *
000500* 入力：商品タイプ・満了日・ON/OFF区分・取引区分・代金・会員ランク *
000600* 出力：手数料金額                                             *
000700*===============================================================*
000800 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000900 DATA DIVISION.
001000 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001100 01 WS-FEE-RATE         PIC 9(1)V99 VALUE 0.     *> 手数料率
001200 01 WS-RESIDUAL-MONTHS  PIC 99       VALUE 0.     *> 残存月数
001300 01 WS-CALC-FEE         PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 0.     *> 手数料計算中
001400 01 WS-TODAY-DATE.
001500     05 WS-TODAY-YEAR   PIC 9(4).
001600     05 WS-TODAY-MONTH  PIC 99.
001700     05 WS-TODAY-DAY    PIC 99.

001800 LINKAGE SECTION.
001900 01 LK-SHOUHIN-TYPE     PIC X(4).
002000 01 LK-MANRYOU-DATE     PIC 9(8).         *> YYYYMMDD
002100 01 LK-ONOFF-KUBUN      PIC X(3).
002200 01 LK-TORIHIKI-KUBUN   PIC X(6).
002300 01 LK-TORIHIKI-DAIKIN  PIC 9(9).
002400 01 LK-KAIIN-RANK       PIC 9.
002500 01 LK-FEE-AMOUNT       PIC 9(9)V99.

002600 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING
002700     LK-SHOUHIN-TYPE
002800     LK-MANRYOU-DATE
002900     LK-ONOFF-KUBUN
003000     LK-TORIHIKI-KUBUN
003100     LK-TORIHIKI-DAIKIN
003200     LK-KAIIN-RANK
003300     LK-FEE-AMOUNT.

003400     PERFORM INIT-DATE-SECTION
003500     PERFORM CALC-FEE-RATE-SECTION
003600     PERFORM DISCOUNT-BY-RANK-SECTION
003700     PERFORM CALC-FINAL-FEE-SECTION
003800     PERFORM END-FEECALC-SECTION
003900     STOP RUN.

004000*------------------------*
004100* 日付初期化セクション  *
004200*------------------------*
004300 INIT-DATE-SECTION.
004400     ACCEPT WS-TODAY-DATE FROM DATE YYYYMMDD.

004500*------------------------*
004600* 手数料率計算セクション*
004700*------------------------*
004800 CALC-FEE-RATE-SECTION.
004900     IF LK-SHOUHIN-TYPE = '株'
005000         IF LK-ONOFF-KUBUN = 'OFF'
005100             EVALUATE TRUE
005200                 WHEN LK-TORIHIKI-DAIKIN <= 50000000
005300                     MOVE 0.50 TO WS-FEE-RATE
005400                 WHEN LK-TORIHIKI-DAIKIN <= 100000000
005500                     MOVE 0.45 TO WS-FEE-RATE
005600                 WHEN LK-TORIHIKI-DAIKIN <= 200000000
005700                     MOVE 0.40 TO WS-FEE-RATE
005800                 WHEN LK-TORIHIKI-DAIKIN <= 500000000
005900                     MOVE 0.35 TO WS-FEE-RATE
006000                 WHEN OTHER
006100                     MOVE 0.30 TO WS-FEE-RATE
006200             END-EVALUATE
006300         ELSE
006400             IF LK-TORIHIKI-KUBUN = 'ネット'
006500                 EVALUATE TRUE
006600                     WHEN LK-TORIHIKI-DAIKIN <= 1000000
006700                         MOVE 0.17 TO WS-FEE-RATE
006800                     WHEN LK-TORIHIKI-DAIKIN <= 9999999
006900                         MOVE 0.15 TO WS-FEE-RATE
007000                     WHEN LK-TORIHIKI-DAIKIN <= 49999999
007100                         MOVE 0.13 TO WS-FEE-RATE
007200                     WHEN LK-TORIHIKI-DAIKIN <= 50000000
007300                         MOVE 0.10 TO WS-FEE-RATE
007400                 END-EVALUATE
007500             ELSE IF LK-TORIHIKI-KUBUN = 'ARS'
007600                 MOVE 0.20 TO WS-FEE-RATE
007700             ELSE
007800                 GO TO END-FEECALC-SECTION
007900             END-IF
008000         END-IF
008100     ELSE IF LK-SHOUHIN-TYPE = '債券'
008200         COMPUTE WS-RESIDUAL-MONTHS = 1
008300*        ※将来的には正確な月数計算を組み込む
008400         EVALUATE TRUE
008500             WHEN WS-RESIDUAL-MONTHS <= 2
008600                 MOVE 0.17 TO WS-FEE-RATE
008700             WHEN WS-RESIDUAL-MONTHS <= 11
008800                 MOVE 0.15 TO WS-FEE-RATE
008900             WHEN WS-RESIDUAL-MONTHS <= 23
009000                 MOVE 0.13 TO WS-FEE-RATE
009100             WHEN OTHER
009200                 MOVE 0.10 TO WS-FEE-RATE
009300         END-EVALUATE
009400     ELSE
009500         GO TO END-FEECALC-SECTION
009600     END-IF.

009700*------------------------*
009800* 会員ランク割引セクション *
009900*------------------------*
010000 DISCOUNT-BY-RANK-SECTION.
010100     EVALUATE LK-KAIIN-RANK
010200         WHEN 1
010300             COMPUTE WS-FEE-RATE = WS-FEE-RATE * 0.5
010400         WHEN 2 THRU 3
010500             COMPUTE WS-FEE-RATE = WS-FEE-RATE * 0.7
010600         WHEN 4
010700             COMPUTE WS-FEE-RATE = WS-FEE-RATE * 0.8
010800         WHEN 5
010900             COMPUTE WS-FEE-RATE = WS-FEE-RATE * 0.95
011000         WHEN OTHER
011100             GO TO END-FEECALC-SECTION
011200     END-EVALUATE.

011300*------------------------*
011400* 手数料最終計算セクション *
011500*------------------------*
011600 CALC-FINAL-FEE-SECTION.
011700     COMPUTE WS-CALC-FEE = LK-TORIHIKI-DAIKIN * WS-FEE-RATE * 0.01
011800     MOVE WS-CALC-FEE TO LK-FEE-AMOUNT.

011900*------------------------*
012000* 終了セクション         *
012100*------------------------*
012200 END-FEECALC-SECTION.
012300     EXIT PROGRAM.

